2686+ 6B26              ; search_by_Busy_dir
2687+ 6B26              ; Bank-safe replacement used by FIND for names returned by get_item_name.
2688+ 6B26              ; IN:  HL = physical name start, BC = 16-bit name length
2689+ 6B26              ;      item_name_page = bank companion for HL
2690+ 6B26              ; Pattern remains INPBUFF, pattern length is the value patched into txtlen+1.
2691+ 6B26              ; OUT: Z=pattern found, NZ=not found
2692+ 6B26              ; One-character input matches only the FIRST character of a name (quick jump).
2693+ 6B26              ; Two or more characters use normal case-insensitive substring search. There is
2694+ 6B26              ; no 255-byte directory-name limit; directory page crossings are transparent.
2695+ 6B26              ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2696+ 6B26              search_by_Busy_dir:
2697+ 6B26                      ; Empty name cannot contain a non-empty search pattern.
2698+ 6B26 78                   ld      a,b
2699+ 6B27 B1                   or      c
