5436+ 7910              ;===============================================================
5437+ 7910              ;http://z80-heaven.wikidot.com/math#toc32
5438+ 7910              ;Input:
5439+ 7910              ;     DE points to the base 10 number string in RAM.
5440+ 7910              ;Outputs:
5441+ 7910              ;     HL is the 16-bit value of the number
5442+ 7910              ;     DE points to the byte after the number
5443+ 7910              ;     BC is HL/10
5444+ 7910              ;     z flag reset (nz)
5445+ 7910              ;     c flag reset (nc)
5446+ 7910              ;Destroys:
5447+ 7910              ;     A (actually, add 30h and you get the ending token)
5448+ 7910              ;Size:  23 bytes
5449+ 7910              ;Speed: 104n+42+11c
5450+ 7910              ;       n is the number of digits
5451+ 7910              ;       c is at most n-2
5452+ 7910              ;       at most 595 cycles for any 16-bit decimal value
5453+ 7910              ;===============================================================
